# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Browse [`qiskit_fermions.protocols`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols#module-qiskit_fermions.protocols \"qiskit_fermions.protocols\") for the full catalog of protocols this package defines, including the conversion protocols ([`SupportsFermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator\"), [`SupportsMajoranaOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-majorana-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator\")) that are unrelated to ffsim.\n"
msgstr "Stöbere in [`qiskit_fermions.protocols`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols#module-qiskit_fermions.protocols \"qiskit_fermions.protocols\") für den vollständigen Katalog der Protokolle, die dieses Paket definiert, einschließlich der Konvertierungsprotokolle ([`SupportsFermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsFermionOperator\"), [`SupportsMajoranaOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/protocols-supports-majorana-operator#qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator \"qiskit_fermions.protocols.SupportsMajoranaOperator\")), die nichts mit ffsim zu tun haben.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read [ffsim’s own guides](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/) for the workflows it owns, in particular [building a UCJ ansatz](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) and [optimizing one variationally](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/simulate-vqe.html). The parameter vectors those guides drive are what [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") and [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") accept, through the operators they build.\n"
msgstr "Lies [ffsims eigene Leitfäden](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/) für die Workflows, die ffsim selbst besitzt, insbesondere [den Aufbau eines UCJ-Ansatzes](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/qiskit-lucj.html) und [dessen variationelle Optimierung](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/how-to-guides/simulate-vqe.html). Die Parametervektoren, die diese Leitfäden steuern, sind das, was [`UCJ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucj#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCJ\") und [`UCC`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-ucc#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.UCC\") über die von ihnen gebauten Operatoren akzeptieren.\n"
